il 0,45 vers 0,83</text><path d="M440,700 v18" stroke="#286853" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/><rect x="90" y="722" width="700" height="104" rx="18" fill="#eef1e9" stroke="#b6c9bc"/><text x="120" y="768" font-size="32">Composant V002</text><text x="120" y="808" font-size="24" class="body">Écarts -3,1 / +3,3 / +3,6 %</text><path d="M440,828 v18" stroke="#286853" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/><rect x="90" y="850" width="700" height="104" rx="18" fill="#eef1e9" stroke="#b6c9bc"/><text x="120" y="896" font-size="32">Œil de Matthieu</text><text x="120" y="936" font-size="24" class="body">Validation en attente</text><image x="840" y="200" width="990" height="543" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" href="data:image/png;base64,"/><text x="840" y="790" font-size="24" class="body">Planche à gauche, composant Houdini à droite : face, profil, dessus.</text><text x="840" y="830" font-size="24" class="body">Silhouettes 0,93 / 0,83 / 0,97, contre 0,90 / 0,45 / 0,97 pour la première version.</text><rect x="840" y="980" width="990" height="64" rx="14" fill="none" stroke="#9aa39d" stroke-dasharray="10 8"/><text x="866" y="1021" font-size="22" class="body" fill="#6b746f">Écartés : bord rabattu profond dès le coin avant, coude de profil trop serré</text></g></svg>